Familiarize Yourself: Spend 15 minutes clicking through the "Intelligence Home" and "Reports" sections (like "Reports" > "Realtime" or "Life cycle" > "Acquisition").

Set Up One Goal: Go to "Admin" (gear icon) → "Data display" → "Conversions". Create a simple goal, like a page view of a "Thank You" page.

Check Weekly: Make it a habit to check your Intelligence Home dashboard every week. The automated insights will become more valuable over time as they learn your site's patterns.

In short, Google Analytics gives you superpowers to understand your visitors. Everything you learn can help you build a better website, create more relevant content, and reach more people—all at no cost.

